  "title": "Potato Soup in Seven Minutes",
  "description": "This creamy potato soup gets a head start with canned cream of chicken soup. Frozen hash brown potatoes and precooked bacon make it even easier! It only needs a few minutes to put together.",
  "authors": [
    "Marlene Osborn"
